  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5608.01 Single Record Requests",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5608.01 Single Record Requests.\n\n(a) The following fees shall be charged for the specified document:\n\n(1) $20.00 for a certified copy of a driving record as specified in RSA 263:42, II;\n\n(2) $20.00 for a certified driver record provided to an insurance company as specified in RSA 260:15, II;\n\n(3) $17.00 for a non-certified driver record pursuant to RSA 260:15, II;\n\n(4) $20.00 for a certified copy of a registration as specified in RSA 263:42, II;\n\n(5) $5 for a current registration listing as specified by RSA 261:60, I and Saf-C 509.12;\n\n(6) $20 for a title search as specified by RSA 261:20, I(f);\n\n(7) $1 per page for accident reports with a minimum of $5; and\n\n(8) $1 for an insurance card filed in connection with an accident.\n\nSource. #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02; ss by #13152, EXEMPT, eff 12-31-20; ss by #14423, EXEMPT, eff 11-6-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5600.html"
